## Citation, computation, and verification

- [CITATION_PLAN.md](../CITATION_PLAN.md) records claim-to-source rationale before bibliography insertion.
- [ENVIRONMENT.md](ENVIRONMENT.md) defines the local Python environment and layered requirement contracts.
- [calculations/README.md](../calculations/README.md) defines calculation-package boundaries and the promotion path for reusable or claim-bearing work.
